<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu eases to 4.6055 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu eases to 4.6055 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu eased to 4.6055 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6035 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 16		  Oct 14</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6055		  4.6035</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    50,000		  50,000</p>
<p>				    Oct 16		  Oct 15</p>
<p> lei per 1,000 roubles	0.8450		  0.8430</p>
<p> volume traded (rbls million)   50			100</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
